			<FieldValue>push-to-talk</FieldValue>
			<FieldType>Dropdown</FieldType>
			<FieldOptions>
				<string>push-to-talk</string>
				<string>open mic</string>
				<string>listen</string>
				<string>off</string>
			</FieldOptions>
			<Hint>Voice chat with the players of your online lobby, directly between the cabinets (or through the matching server when they cannot reach each other); nothing is recorded. push-to-talk = talk while the key is held, open mic = talk whenever you speak, listen = speakers only. F3 turns it on/off in the game. The microphone is only open while it can be used, and never while the game is in the background.</Hint>
		</FieldInformation>
